    "text": "A diode AM detector with the output circuit consisting of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi>kW</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi>μF</mi></math> would be more suitable for detecting a carrier signal of"
